  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "What this board is, and what it is not",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**This board says whether the fleet's evidence can be trusted. It makes no claim about whether the fleet is compliant.** Every number on the CIS and Essential Eight boards is derived from two feeds: Puppet agent runs and compliance scans. This board checks whether those feeds are current, complete and honest.\n\n**An empty or zero panel here usually means the reassuring thing, and it means the same as it does everywhere else in this family: absence is \"not evidenced\", never \"not met\".** A guarded tile reading \"Not collected\" means a collector is off, not that the fleet has nothing wrong with it.\n\n**The funnel below is the honest denominator.** Read every percentage on the Standards boards against the claimable count at the end of it, not against the raw node count at the start.\n"
      },
      "id": 497422005
    },
    {
      "title": "1. How much of the fleet can we make a claim about",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 683888540
    },
    {
      "title": "Known to Puppet",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(puppet_evidence_known_count{environment=~\"${environment}\",environment!=\"all\",alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#8e949f",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Not collected"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Nodes PuppetDB has a report from in this window. Not the charter's \"expected in the source of truth\": pdctng has no inventory outside PuppetDB to check against, so a node that stopped reporting and was never replaced is invisible here too.",
      "id": 1305251123
    },
